## Rules
- One doc per interface, created from [`CONTRACT.template.md`](CONTRACT.template.md).
- If a doc disagrees with the code or schema, **the code/schema wins** — fix the doc.
- `<<schema_dir>>/**` is a **protected path** — schema changes need human approval.
- Record the envelope/error-model decision as an [ADR](../adr/).
